@startuml US_3_2_5_C1
title US 3.2.5 - Cenário de gestão de roles

actor Admin
participant SPA as "Admin UI"
participant API as "AdminController"
database DB as "PortContext"
participant Mail as "ActivationLinkService / Email"

Admin -> SPA: escolhe utilizador
SPA -> API: PUT /admin/users/{id}/role(s)
API -> DB: atualizar UserRoles
API -> Mail: enviar link de ativação/role-change (se aplicável)
Mail --> User: email com link

@enduml
